  "id": "propoxyphene",
  "term": "propoxyphene",
  "definition": "Propoxyphene is a synthetic opioid drug made as a mixture of forms and used for narcotic pain relief. Its pain-reducing effects come mainly from dextropropoxyphene acting on opioid receptors in the central nervous system, which lowers the release of several neurotransmitters and reduces nerve cell excitability.",
